OL,3,GNEWSAVape store manager jailed for
OL,4,Aabusing teen girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manager of a vape shop who sexually
OL,7,Fabused teenage girls after giving them
OL,8,Ffree e-cigarettes has been jailed.
OL,10,FDilshaw Kawani, 53, was sentenced to
OL,11,Feight years after he was found guilty
OL,12,Fat Bournemouth Crown Court of seven
OL,13,Foffences of sexual assault and inciting
OL,14,Fa child to engage in sexual activity
OL,15,Fagainst two victims.
OL,17,FDorset Police investigated Kawani, who
OL,18,Fmanaged Parkstone Mini Market in Ashley
OL,19,FRoad, Poole, in January 2025 after a
OL,20,Fteenage girl reported that he had
OL,21,Fsexually touched her under her clothing
OL,22,Fafter giving her free vapes.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
